<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-3738] Fix enabling JMX in ZeppelinServer</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-3738</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;There is a typo in the system variable name &lt;b&gt;ZEPPELIN_JMX_ENABLE&lt;/b&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
    &lt;span class=&quot;code-comment&quot;&gt;// Register MBean
&lt;/span&gt;    &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; (&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;&quot;&lt;/span&gt;.equals(&lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;System&lt;/span&gt;.getenv(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;ZEPPELIN_ENABLE_JMX&quot;&lt;/span&gt;))) {
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;P.S. variable defined in zeppelin-env.sh.template (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/3014&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;ZEPPELIN 3422&lt;/a&gt;):&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
# export ZEPPELIN_JMX_ENABLE    		# Enable JMX feature by defining &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;&quot;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
