        // Register MBean&lt;br/&gt;
        if (&quot;true&quot;.equals(System.getenv(&quot;ZEPPELIN_ENABLE_JMX&quot;))) {&lt;br/&gt;
    ```&lt;br/&gt;
    Variable defined in zeppelin-env.sh.template ([&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-3422&quot; title=&quot;Add JMX support&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;ZEPPELIN-3422&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;ZEPPELIN-3422&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;](&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-3422)):&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-3422)):&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
    ```&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;export ZEPPELIN_JMX_ENABLE    		# Enable JMX feature by defining &quot;true&quot;&lt;br/&gt;
    ```&lt;br/&gt;
    Also ZEPPELIN_JMX_ENABLE not mentioned in docs.
